      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的梦想本身是尊贵而美妙的。\n所以，如果说有什么原因的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2aa612267e49938e5ad5d78fed67c24b3c7b3742c1cb9cdd0c59b95a63c1a7e",
